{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "A Night Filled With the Sound of Rain",
    "steam_appid": 3556740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/b6b42f9f0ea3b5b1282148d6783eb9d9.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One rainy night during your trip, you get lost and come across a bar. On a whim, you step inside. The sound of raindrops pattering against the ground is still faintly audible as your eyes land on a mysterious woman named Michiru. After sharing a few drinks, you get to know each other. Your conversation drifts from topic to topic, creating an unforgettable night as your surroundings melt away, leaving only you and your gorgeous companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/d2614af3a2efafc9f84d58a7eeada9d5.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the cocktail you order, the topic of conversation changes. Your talks with Michiru will broaden with the different options you pick. Would you like a pretty Sunset Blue or a dazzling Cosmo Zone? Follow the story to its end and see how this night will unfold in this atmospheric indie game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/2deb82d68cf535755c6d6ef077f69161.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/9d57f4135134ccf2bdb2dd0f7ea0d4a7.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/33a6e4b9428450ada3e9f4a1e1802601.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dynamic Conversations</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The subject of your chats with Michiru depends on which cocktail you order. Try out all the drinks and learn everything you can about this mysterious woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immaculate Vibes</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world made to soothe the soul with its lo-fi music and stunning pixel art.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/b6b42f9f0ea3b5b1282148d6783eb9d9.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One rainy night during your trip, you get lost and come across a bar. On a whim, you step inside. The sound of raindrops pattering against the ground is still faintly audible as your eyes land on a mysterious woman named Michiru. After sharing a few drinks, you get to know each other. Your conversation drifts from topic to topic, creating an unforgettable night as your surroundings melt away, leaving only you and your gorgeous companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/d2614af3a2efafc9f84d58a7eeada9d5.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the cocktail you order, the topic of conversation changes. Your talks with Michiru will broaden with the different options you pick. Would you like a pretty Sunset Blue or a dazzling Cosmo Zone? Follow the story to its end and see how this night will unfold in this atmospheric indie game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/2deb82d68cf535755c6d6ef077f69161.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/9d57f4135134ccf2bdb2dd0f7ea0d4a7.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556740/extras/33a6e4b9428450ada3e9f4a1e1802601.avif?t=1748511687\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dynamic Conversations</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The subject of your chats with Michiru depends on which cocktail you order. Try out all the drinks and learn everything you can about this mysterious woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immaculate Vibes</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world made to soothe the soul with its lo-fi music and stunning pixel art.</p>",
    "short_description": "A rainy night brings you to a small bar. When you step inside, you're met with soothing music. Your eyes land on a beautiful woman by the counter. Get to know Michiru and share your story with her. This unforgettable evening will be etched into your memory forever.",
